      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "[VRCSDK3-WORLD-2020.12.09.04.44_Public]\nThe secret ingredient is the False output of a Branch node!\n1. Output Networking.GetLocalPlayer to two executable nodes\n2. Output a Branch node's True and False channels to each of those nodes\n3. Send execution flow through the False channel\n4. Get exception error!\nnotes:\n- If you execute flow through the True channel, no issue\n- if you disconnect the True channel and execute through the False channel, no issue",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
