  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-03-28T22:21:48.925Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The provided graph for player locomotion options will cause a VM error at runtime.  If however, 4 localplayer nodes are used for each function, no error will be produced.\n\nHeap Dump:\n  0x00000000: False\n  0x00000001: null\n  0x00000002: VRC.SDKBase.VRCPlayerApi\n  0x00000003: 2\n  0x00000004: null\n  0x00000005: 4\n  0x00000006: null\n...\n ---> VRC.Udon.VM.UdonVMException: An exception occurred during EXTERN to 'VRCSDKBaseVRCPlayerApi.__SetRunSpeed__SystemSingle__SystemVoid'.\n    Parameter Addresses: 0x00000004, 0x00000005\n ---> System.NullReferenceException: Object reference not set to an instance of an object.",
